  "tipsReduceTitle": "Reduce my waste",
  "tipsReduceItems": "Carry a reusable bag and bottle.|Buy in bulk or large packs rather than single portions.|Refuse flyers: a “No junk mail” sticker on the mailbox is enough.|Repair, give away or resell before throwing out.|Compost peelings if you have a balcony or garden.|Group your recyclables into one well-filled pickup.",
